# Change management

## Before

1. Inspect current implementation + relevant docs  
2. Identify dependencies and affected repos  
3. Identify security/data risks  
4. Define intended behavior  
5. Make the smallest safe change  

## After

- Inspect the diff; remove accidental edits  
- Check compatibility; run relevant tests  
- Update docs when ops/security/architecture changed  
- Report remaining risks  

Prefer reversible changes. No unrelated refactors. No destructive migrations without explicit approval and a verified recovery plan.
